// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2006157955" "Force Field"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P861244890" "+DEF"
// Power Help Text :
"P1299022806" "When armor plating and resistant materials are not enough to protect your valuable equipment, a High-Energy Force Shield is just the thing. Designed for use in hostile environments and able to withstand full combat conditions, this force shield is the perfect supplement to any items defenses."

// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Arcane_Force_Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2501182180" "Arcane_Force_Field"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Force Field 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Help Text :
"P1228657382" "Through a rift to the Shadow Shard, this device creates a shell of energy that protects all within it."

// ******************************************************************************** 
