// ******************************************************************************** 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power Set : Items_Of_Power 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DisplayName :
"P2522340730" "Items_Of_Power"
// DisplayShortHelp :
"P3743631124" "Item of Power"
// DisplayHelp :
"P3021943971" "Protects you from the aftereffects of defeat."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The One Book of Rularuu 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3028481180" "The One Book of Rularuu"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P1265099495" "Debt Protection"
// Power Help Text :
"P2959677480" "This book is said to contain the essence of the timelines that have been, are and could be. Each letter is beyond the comprehension of all but Rularuu. Nonetheless, the tiniest fragment bestows power to those who possess it. The One Book gives a 50%% reduction to debt incurred by all Supergroup members at all times."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The Perfect Eye 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2919505575" "The Perfect Eye"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2133768508" "+Perception"
// Power Help Text :
"P701986640" "This is the unblinking guardian of Rularuu's cathedral. Its gaze pierces darkness and even dimensions. The Perfect Eye aids supergroup members by increasing their chances of spotting those using stealth powers."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : The True Furnace 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P3195497801" "The True Furnace"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2301280604" "+Max End"
// Power Help Text :
"P1658926217" "This is the True Furnace Rularuu used to construct his inter-dimensional factory cubes. Although it cannot be harnessed, the True Furnace radiates energy, increasing the Endurance of every Supergroup member and supplying power to all items in a base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Heart of a Storm Elemental 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P606920834" "Heart of a Storm Elemental"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2186260285" "+Max HP"
// Power Help Text :
"P3665251977" "Not all Rularuu's treasures have physical form. Hovering here is the Heart of Daralak, a mighty brute. The Heart increases the health of all members of a Super Group."
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3075202721" "Not all Rularuu's treasures have physical form. Hovering here is the heart of Daralak, a mighty brute. The Heart increases the health of all members of a Super Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Anger Monument 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P334556905" "Anger Monument"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3937184860" "Enhances Damage"
// Power Help Text :
"P914387179" "Carved with strange glyphs that scholars have yet to decipher, the Anger Monument radiates with evil power. When this is in your base, it gives all members a small bonus to damage. You can have up to 5 copies in your base."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Torment Monument 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2354559707" "Torment Monument"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P341426499" "Debt Reduction Bonus"
// Power Help Text :
"P2603994222" "Said to be etched with the pain and suffering of Rularuu's victims, this stone perversely allows members to repay debt quicker. You may have up to 5 copies of this item."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Crystal of Resilience 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P2857996439" "Monument of Iron"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P2388627655" "Resist(Hold, Sleep, Immob, Stun)"
// Power Help Text :
"P4256895909" "Harder than diamond, the Monument of Iron confers a slight resistance to certain mind-affecting powers. You can have up to 5 copies of this item."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Power : Fury Monument 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Display Name :
"P1744438895" "Fury Monument"
// Power Mouse-Over Text :
"P3528521403" "+XP"
// Power Help Text :
"P3555663300" "This item of power has been imbued with the fury of Rularuu's ambition. This power actually gives a small bonus to experience earned for all Supergroup members. You can have up to 5 copies of this item."
